                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Something you should know before buying this game, this game is not a traditional platformer in the sense that you press forward on controls and he goes forward..... there is no forward control, or any directional control for that matter, forward movement is automatic and non-stop, the only two controls are jump and attack.\n\nI don't know why they've chosen to take this approach, and I personally would have prefered a more traditional platformer.... but it doesn't hinder the gameplay too much, and you do get used to it........ otherwise, so far I'd have to say the gameplay feel solid, and as you can probably expect, the protagonist is comedy wrapped up in a yellow 70s jumpsuit and an afro.",
